class_name LandmarkRegistryCapitalStations
extends RefCounted

## The main railway stations of the capitals that have a hand-built
## model (LandmarkSetCapitalStations, scripts/generation/landmarks/
## capital_stations). The model frame: +X along the main facade, +Z out to
## the forecourt, the tracks toward -Z; lat/lon is the model origin and
## yaw_deg turns the frame onto the map, both from the OpenStreetMap
## outline (tools/capital_stations.py dump). Secondary: a station stands
## beside a capital's icons, never instead of them. clear_rect_m covers the
## model's footprint, so the streets round it keep their buildings.
## Every other capital's station: LandmarkRegistryCapitalStationsOsm.

